# Battle pacing look (battle-pace): screenshots every 20 frames through round 1 on Fast.: the whole first Delrich Temple battle on the default speed (Fast),
# A every 20 frames from the first command to the field. Logs the battle main state (0x020B0010) and the
# speed level; compare the frame of each state with pace_battle_normal.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
watch u32 0x020B0010 main_state
include warp6
watch u32 0x020B8540 speed_level
wait 270
press A 3
wait 17
shot pf_01
press A 3
wait 17
shot pf_02
press A 3
wait 17
shot pf_03
press A 3
wait 17
